<title>CANADA: Newport share issue fetches C$27.4 million.</title>
<headline>Newport share issue fetches C$27.4 million.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport Petroleum Corp said on Monday it closed its issue of four million shares at C$6.85 each for gross proceeds of C$27.4 million.</p>
<p>Newport said the funds would be used to accelerate exploration and development in Alberta and British Columbia for the rest of 1996 and part of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said its capital budget for this year was boosted to C$50 million and its preliminary spending estimate for 1997 was set at C$75 million.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
